Het CoWR-gc-gpu-fence
"Heterogeneous CoWR-gc-gpu-fence: per-proc device assignment gpu,cpu (cpu=AArch64, gpu=LISA/PTX)"
{
1:X1=x;
}
 P0:gpu              | P1:cpu      ;
 w[relaxed,gpu] x 2  | MOV W0,#1   ;
 f[sc,gpu]           | STR W0,[X1] ;
 r[relaxed,gpu] r0 x |             ;
scopes: (sys (gpu (cta P0)))
exists (0:r0=0 /\ [x]=2)
